  "title": "Ziyarat of Abdullah ibn Abd al-Muttalib, Father of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.)",
  "data": "First Form\nAt the site of his grave, opposite Bab al-Salam of the Prophet's Mosque, recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WALIYYALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O friend of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَمِيْنَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA AMEENALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O trustee of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُوْرَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA NOORALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O light of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُسْتَوْدَعَ نُوْرِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MUSTAWDA'A NOORI RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O repository of the light of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَالِدَ خَاتَمِ الْاَنْبِيَاۤءِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAALIDA KHAATAMIL ANBIYAA'\nPeace be upon you, O father of the Seal of the Prophets.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنِ انْتَهٰى اِلَيْهِ الْوَدِيْعَةُ وَالْاَمَانَةُ الْمَنِيْعَةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MANIN TAHAA ILAYHIL WADEE'ATU WAL AMAANATUL MANEE'AH\nPeace be upon you, O you to whom the deposit and the inviolable trust came down.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ اَوْدَعَ اللّٰهُ فِيْ صُلْبِهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MAN AWDA'ALLAAHU FEE SULBIH\nPeace be upon you, O you in whose loins,\nالطَّيِّبِ الطَّاهِرِ الْمَكِيْنِ نُوْرَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ الصَّادِقِ الْاَمِيْنِ\nAT-TAYYIBIT TAAHIRIL MAKEENI NOORA RASOOLILLAAHIS SAADIQIL AMEEN\ngood, pure and firm, Allah placed the light of the Messenger of Allah, the truthful, the trustworthy.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَالِدَ سَيِّدِ الْاَنْبِيَاۤءِ وَالْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAALIDA SAYYIDIL ANBIYAA'I WAL MURSALEEN\nPeace be upon you, O father of the master of the prophets and messengers.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ حَفِظْتَ الْوَصِيَّةَ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA QAD HAFIZTAL WASIYYAH\nI bear witness that you safeguarded the bequest,\nوَاَدَّيْتَ الْاَمَانَةَ عَنْ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ فِيْ رَسُوْلِهٖ\nWA ADDAYTAL AMAANATA A'N RABBIL A'ALAMEENA FEE RASOOLIH\nand fulfilled the trust of the Lord of the worlds concerning His Messenger,\nوَكُنْتَ فِيْ دِيْنِكَ عَلٰى يَقِيْنٍ\nWA KUNTA FEE DEENIKA A'LAA YAQEEN\nand were certain in your faith.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ اتَّبَعْتَ دِيْنَ اللّٰهِ عَلٰى مِنْهَاجِ جَدِّكَ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKAT TABA'TA DEENALLAAHI A'LAA MINHAAJI JADDIK\nAnd I bear witness that you followed the religion of Allah on the way of your forefather\nاِبْرَاهِيْمَ خَلِيْلِ اللّٰهِ فِيْ حَيَاتِكَ وَبَعْدَ وَفَاتِكَ\nIBRAAHEEMA KHALEELILLAAHI FEE HAYAATIKA WA BA'DA WAFAATIK\nIbrahim, the Friend of Allah, in your life and after your death,\nعَلٰى مَرْضَاتِ اللّٰهِ فِيْ رَسُوْلِهٖ\nA'LAA MARDAATILLAAHI FEE RASOOLIH\nseeking the pleasure of Allah in His Messenger;\nوَاَقْرَرْتَ وَصَدَّقْتَ بِنُبُوَّةِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nWA AQRARTA WA SADDAQTA BINUBUWWATI RASOOLILLAAH\nand that you acknowledged and believed in the prophethood of the Messenger of Allah,\nصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nmay Allah bless him and his family,\nوَوِلَايَةِ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nWA WILAAYATI AMEERIL MU'MINEENA A'LAYHIS SALAAM\nand in the guardianship of Amir al-Mu'minin, peace be upon him,\nوَالْاَئِمَّةِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ\nWAL A'IMMATIT TAAHIREENA A'LAYHIMUS SALAAM\nand of the pure Imams, peace be upon them.\nفَصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْكَ حَيًّا وَمَيِّتًا وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nFASALLALLAAHU A'LAYKA HAYYAN WA MAYYITAN WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nSo may Allah bless you in life and in death, and the mercy of Allah and His blessings be upon you.",
  "tabs": [
    "Second Form\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَاحِبَ الْمَجْدِ الْاَثِيْلِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAAHIBAL MAJDIL ATHEEL\nPeace be upon you, O possessor of deep-rooted glory.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خِيَرَةَ فَرْعٍ مِنْ دَوْحَةِ الْخَلِيْلِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA KHIYARATA FAR'IN MIN DAWHATIL KHALEEL\nPeace be upon you, O choicest branch of the great tree of the Friend of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ الذَّبِيْحِ اِسْمَاعِيْلَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAABNADH DHABEEHI ISMAA'EEL\nPeace be upon you, O son of the one offered for sacrifice, Isma'il.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سُلَالَةَ الْاَبْرَارِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SULAALATAL ABRAAR\nPeace be upon you, O descendant of the righteous.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا النَّبِيِّ الْمُخْتَارِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA ABAN NABIYYIL MUKHTAAR\nPeace be upon you, O father of the chosen Prophet,\nوَعَمَّ الْوَصِيِّ الْكَرَّارِ وَوَالِدَ الْاَئِمَّةِ الْاَطْهَارِ\nWA A'MMAL WASIYYIL KARRAARI WA WAALIDAL A'IMMATIL AT-HAAR\nuncle of the successor who charged again and again, and forefather of the pure Imams.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ اَضَاۤءَتْ بِنُوْرِ جَبِيْنِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MAN ADAA'AT BINOORI JABEENIH\nPeace be upon you, O you by the light of whose brow\nعِنْدَ وِلَادَتِهٖ اَطْرَافُ السَّمَاۤءِ\nI'NDA WILAADATIHEE ATRAAFUS SAMAA'\nthe ends of the sky shone when you were born.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا يُوْسُفَ اٰلِ عَبْدِ مَنَافٍ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA YOOSUFA AALI A'BDI MANAAF\nPeace be upon you, O Yusuf of the house of Abd Manaf.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ سَلَكَ مَسْلَكَ جَدِّهٖ اِسْمَاعِيْلَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MAN SALAKA MASLAKA JADDIHEE ISMAA'EEL\nPeace be upon you, O you who walked the way of your forefather Isma'il\nفَاَسْلَمَ لِاَبِيْهِ لِيَذْبَحَهٗ\nFA-ASLAMA LI-ABEEHI LIYADHBAHAH\nand gave yourself up to your father to be sacrificed.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ فَدَاهُ اللّٰهُ بِمَا فَدَاهُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MAN FADAAHULLAAHU BIMAA FADAAH\nPeace be upon you, O you whom Allah ransomed with what He ransomed you,\nفَتَقَبَّلَهٗ فَاَعْطَاهُ اللّٰهُ اَبَاهُ\nFATAQABBALAHOO FA-A'TAAHULLAAHU ABAAH\nand He accepted it, and Allah gave you back to your father.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَامِلَ نُوْرِ النُّبُوَّةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HAAMILA NOORIN NUBUWWAH\nPeace be upon you, O bearer of the light of prophethood.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَشْرَفَ النَّاسِ فِي الْاُبُوَّةِ وَالْبُنُوَّةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA ASHRAFAN NAASI FIL UBUWWATI WAL BUNUWWAH\nPeace be upon you, O noblest of people as a father and as a son.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَالِدَ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAALIDA KHAATAMIN NABIYYEEN\nPeace be upon you, O father of the Seal of the Prophets.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا الطَّاهِرِيْنَ بَعْدَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ وَابْنَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA ABAT TAAHIREENA BA'DAT TAAHIREENA WABNAT TAAHIREEN\nPeace be upon you, O father of the pure, one after another, and son of the pure,\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nand the mercy of Allah and His blessings."
